          "contentRef": "section:artifacts-promotion:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 3",
          "text": "部署後記錄正在執行的摘要和監控結果。"
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:artifacts-promotion:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "結論",
          "text": "可以確認通過測試的內容與生產環境中執行的內容一致。"
